{"asset_key":"ep7/env_story_17322800","episode":"ep7","category":"env_story","story_id":"17322800","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1732280001:0":{"text":"히이잉! 맨날 알맹이는 쏙 빼놓고 빙빙 돌려 말한다니까.","source_cn":"咴咴，贵族们什么都聊，但什么也不愿意说清楚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2FCD05BA7431FB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1732280002:0":{"text":"히이잉, 어떤 요리 이야기를 한다면 플레이팅이니, 맛이니 식감이니... 전부 이야기하지만 그게 맛있는지는 절대 이야기하지 않아.","source_cn":"咴咴，比如讨论一个菜式，他们会把摆盘味道和口感都聊一遍...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76F52561D6F93530","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1732280003:0":{"text":"히이잉, 건초보다 더 영양가 없는 이야기잖아. 그걸 대체 왜 좋아하는 거야?","source_cn":"咴，所以我搞不懂你听那些比干草还没味道的聊天干嘛？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3906A5673CAE52F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:白马":{"text":"흰 말","source":"白马","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:棕马":{"text":"갈색 말","source":"棕马","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}